    <name>Six Winds</name>
    <description>The shamanic faith of the steppe. Tengri rules the eternal sky; Etugen the green earth beneath the hoof; Sülde the war-banner; and the Asra ride at the back of every host. The shamans answer to clan first, spirit second.</description>
