         group="nord_chieftains"
         marriage_doctrine="Monogamy"
         war_doctrine="OpenWarfare">
    <name>Osfeydian Tradition</name>
    <description>The reaver-faith of the Nordvyg, named for the burnt shore where Osric's host first beached. Hreinwald rules the deep; Skǫll the wake; the Vethari ride in the longships' wash. Its rites bless the prow before raid and the axe before kin.</description>
